{#demo-additional-notes}
> ### Additional notes
> - In the Tetris demo above, without dynamic seed discovery (the `--profile` flag), roughly 96–97% of executed cycles run as lifted LLVM IR, and the remainder falls back to the emulator.
> - After running the compiled binary with `--profile` for about a minute and then recompiling with the entry points it discovered, roughly 99.2% of executed cycles run as lifted LLVM IR, and the remainder falls back to the emulator.

{pause=demo-additional-notes up="~duration:0.5 demo-additional-notes"}

